 agency for tours, activities, and attractions, and acts as travel guidance platforms for travelers to discover, generate, and share authentic user-generated content in the form of ratings and reviews and opinions for destinations, points-of-interest, experiences, accommodations, restaurants, and cruises. The Hotels and Other segment primarily consist of the Tripadvisor hotel and restaurant guidance platform, which include hotel metasearch, and related advertising offerings primarily for hotels and restaurants. TheFork segment provides an online marketplace, which enables diners to discover and book online reservations at restaurants. Tripadvisor, Inc. was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Matthew  Goldberg | President, CEO & Director | Age 54 | Compensation: $1.9M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 2K people. Revenue per employee of $730K ranks in the top quartile among Consumer Cyclical peers, improving at 8%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $63K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $42K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 3\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (5/10).","financial_summary":["TripAdvisor, Inc. is a small-cap consumer cyclical business with a $815M market cap on $1.9B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +8% over the past three years and +2% annually across the full decade, a respectable pace for a business of this size. Operating margins are contracting by -2.8pp, the first warning that competitive pressure is eroding the franchise.","Returns on capital run at 7% against a 7% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The business throws off $163M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 9 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 6.12\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.8\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and thin 1.3\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Management returns a meaningful 11.0% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.4) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (38.8% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Operating margins softening -2.8pp YoY \u2014 early warning on the moat","sev":"amber","cat":"trend"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 30% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.30294568056931803},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 68/100): roic below cost of capital; durably derated by the market \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Consumer Cyclical tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Brand relevance decay \u2014 shifting consumer preferences and social-media-driven trends can strand inventory and invalidate positioning faster than product cycles can adapt.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 44% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Consumer Cyclical sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Tripadvisor (TRIP) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/tripadvisor-trip-q3-2026-earnings-180152393.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793988112.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"TripAdvisor (NASDAQ:TRIP) Price Target Cut to $6.00 by Analysts at Cantor Fitzgerald","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/tripadvisor-nasdaqtrip-price-target-cut-to-6-00-by-analysts-at-cantor-fitzgerald.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793970459.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.226,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"Tripadvisor shares plummet on CEO, CFO departure news","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/tripadvisor-shares-plummet-ceo-cfo-192900881.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793993340.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.296,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["leadership"]},{"title":"Tripadvisor downgraded by BofA as CEO and CFO exits add risk","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/tripadvisor-downgraded-bofa-ceo-cfo-181300406.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793988780.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.557,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action","leadership"]},{"title":"TripAdvisor's Geoffrey Gouvalaris Acquires 8,973 RSUs on November 4, 2026","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/tripadvisors-geoffrey-gouvalar